  <section id="pools">
    <h2>Pools and things to do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Copper Creek Springs Pool</strong> is the main pool. It is heated, with a 67-foot slide built into the rocks, hot and cold whirlpool spas, and a children's play area. Geyser Point Bar &amp; Grill is next to it.</li>
      <li><strong>Boulder Ridge Cove Pool</strong> is a quieter zero-entry pool with a whirlpool spa, at the Boulder Ridge Villas. Lodge and Copper Creek guests can use it.</li>
    </ul>
