  <section id="booking">
    <h2>Booking and value tips</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Compare a Copper Creek one-bedroom with a Boulder Ridge studio if you need a fifth bed.</strong> Copper Creek's one-bedroom is listed as sleeping four; Boulder Ridge studios are listed as sleeping five.</li>
      <li><strong>Don't assume a cabin is just a fancier two-bedroom villa.</strong> The bed layout and the Bay Lake setting are different, and so is the price.</li>
      <li><strong>Disney Vacation Club members book with points; cash rates are full rack prices.</strong> Discounts can exist, but the ranges above are the published 2026 rack rates, tax included.</li>
    </ul>
